1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,386
TopoMarket explores how market structure changes under stress and tests whether topology can flag major declines early.

2
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,198
Start with twelve industry portfolios.

3
00:00:09,218 --> 00:00:15,282
As I move from a quiet window to a stressed one, more industries begin moving together.

4
00:00:16,050 --> 00:00:19,708
The correlation map shows which industries move together.

5
00:00:19,728 --> 00:00:25,310
Mapper groups them by similar behavior and highlights industries shared between groups.

6
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:33,505
A separate indicator uses the shape of recent S&P 500 returns to flag unusual behavior.

7
00:00:33,525 --> 00:00:36,790
Here is the alert and the feature behind it.

8
00:00:39,050 --> 00:00:41,622
Replay shows when the alert appeared.

9
00:00:41,642 --> 00:00:46,438
Revealing the outcome lets us see that the decline had already begun.

10
00:00:50,050 --> 00:00:53,914
The results show where the signal works and where it misses.

11
00:00:55,050 --> 00:00:58,602
Explore the code and the live demo on GitHub.
